                            </div>
                            <div class="list_block_box_right">
                                <a href="/news/ASUS-Ready-to--Ship-NVIDIA-HGX-Rubin-NVL8-Systems">
                                    <p class="title bold">ASUS Ready to Ship NVIDIA HGX Rubin NVL8 Systems</p>
                                </a>
                                <p>ASUS today announced that the all-new ASUS’s systems build on NVIDIA HGX Rubin NVL8 are ready to launch in Q4 2026, with both partial-rack and full-rack configurations available. The portfolio includes the 3U hybrid-cooled XR R1I12B-M1BHFS and 2U 100% liq</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="list_block_box">
                            <div class="list_block_box_left">
                                <p class="text-center number">12</p>
                                <p class="text-center">October </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="list_block_box_right">
                                <a href="/news/ASUS-Unveils-XA-P2N-E2-Powered-by-NVIDIA-Vera-CPU-for-Agentic-AI-Workloads-at-OCP-2026">
                                    <p class="title bold">ASUS Unveils XA P2N-E2 Powered by NVIDIA Vera CPU for Agentic AI Workloads at OCP 2026</p>
                                </a>
                                <p>ASUS is expanding its AI infrastructure portfolio with the launch of the XA P2N-E2, a 2U NVIDIA MGX architecture-based server powered by NVIDIA Vera CPUs and designed for agentic AI and reinforcement learning workloads. Unveiled at OCP Global Summit 2026,</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="list_block_box">
                            <div class="list_block_box_left">
                                <p class="text-center number">14</p>
                                <p class="text-center">September </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="list_block_box_right">
                                <a href="/news/ASUS-DCD-London-AI-Factories-with-NVIDIA-Vera-Rubin-HGX-Rubin-System">
                                    <p class="title bold">ASUS to Bridge the Gap from Local AI Development to Hyperscale AI Factories at DCD Connect London </p>
                                </a>
                                <p>At DCD Connect London Booth 35, ASUS showcases its progressive NVIDIA-Certified Systems™, acting as a single, comprehensive partner for organisations scaling up from initial experimentation to high-volume token generation.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="list_block_box">
                            <div class="list_block_box_left">
                                <p class="text-center number">10</p>
                                <p class="text-center">September </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="list_block_box_right">
                                <a href="/news/ASUS-GITEX-Turkey-Istanbul">
                                    <p class="title bold">ASUS Showcases Cutting-Edge AI and High-Performance Computing Solutions at GITEX Istanbul 2026 </p>
                                </a>
                                <p>ASUS will present its latest innovations in artificial intelligence, high-performance computing (HPC), and data center solutions at GITEX AI T&#252;rkiye 2026, held at the Istanbul Expo Center. The company will highlight its newest systems, powered by NVIDIA a</p>
                            </div>
