                        <div class="list_block_box">
                            <div class="list_block_box_left">
                                <p class="text-center number">3</p>
                                <p class="text-center">September </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="list_block_box_right">
                                <a href="/news/ASUS-Advances-AI-Factories-with-Integrated-Infrastructure-and-Operational-Governance">
                                    <p class="title bold">ASUS Advances AI Factories with Integrated Infrastructure and Operational Governance</p>
                                </a>
                                <p>At ASUS AI Tech 2026, ASUS today redefined AI infrastructure from systems that run AI to platforms that build and operate AI factories. Working with NVIDIA and a growing ecosystem of technology partners — including Aleria, AMD, Crusoe, Foxlink, IBM, Intel</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="list_block_box">
